# European Forest Disturbance Mapping

This repository contains the code used for forest disturbance mapping
and validation across Europe.

## Repository structure

### `mapping/`
Code for preprocessing Landsat time series, disturbance detection,
and generation of annual forest disturbance maps.

### `validation/`
Code for the sampling design, reference data processing, and accuracy
assessment of the disturbance maps.

### `area_estimation/`
Code for sample-based disturbance area estimation and associated
uncertainty calculations.

## Citation
Viana-Soto, A., Mense, J. A., Kowalski, K., Pauls, J., Gieseke, F., & Senf, C. (2026). 
Deep learning-based forest disturbance mapping for Europe using Landsat time series. Under review
